{"articleNo":"2557","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2557&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 후기 일반대학원 학위수여예정자 졸업외국어시험 면제 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.07","hit":"11350","attachments":[{"name":"일반대학원 졸업외국어시험 면제신청원(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2557&attachNo=1979"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"469\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009학년도 후기 일반대학원 학위수여예정자</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;졸업외국어시험 면제 신청 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">1. 신청자격 : 2009학년도 후기 학위수여예정자(2010. 08. 학위수여예정자)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 면제신청원 1부, 면제관련 증빙서류(사본) 1부 첨부 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 졸업외국어시험 면제요건 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중(최근 3년이내)에 TOEIC 성적이 500점</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 500점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중 어학교육원에서 시행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">중급이상의 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">영어강좌를 40시간 이상 이수한 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 졸업외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 07. 14.(수) ~ 07. 19.(월) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면제신청원 양식 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">5. 합격자 발표 : 2010. 07. 26.(월) 원스톱서비스</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 경로 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/학적자료조회/외국어시험(Y or N)으로 표기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 07</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
